        "tab_details": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Details",
            "content": "<p>Designed for the woman whose weekend bag should look as considered as the rest of her wardrobe, the Weekender pairs a full-grain leather flap, rolled handles, and trim with a tightly woven heavyweight canvas body. The silhouette borrows from the most recognizable structured bag of the last four decades — scaled for travel, with a working turn-lock, belted clasp straps, and reinforced leather corners exactly where a travel bag takes its hits. It opens wide, packs days of clothing, and holds its shape whether it's full or empty. Made in limited runs — the rare travel bag that gets treated like a handbag.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_materials": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Materials & Care",
            "content": "<p><strong>Body:</strong> Tightly woven heavyweight canvas.<br/><strong>Flap, Handles &amp; Trim:</strong> Full-grain leather with burnished edges and visible stitching.<br/><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold-tone turn-lock, clasp plates, and buckles.<br/><strong>Interior:</strong> Natural cotton-canvas lining with a leather slip pocket.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Spot-clean the canvas with a soft, damp cloth. Wipe the leather with a clean, dry cloth and condition it every few months — it will darken and gain character with wear. Store stuffed and away from direct sunlight.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_dimensions": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Dimensions & Fit",
            "content": "<p><strong>Medium:</strong> approx. 16&quot; W &times; 13&quot; H &times; 6.5&quot; D — an overnight trip or an oversized everyday carry; slides under an airline seat.</p><p><strong>Medium Large:</strong> approx. 18&quot; W &times; 14.5&quot; H &times; 7&quot; D — the true weekender: two to three days of clothing, a toiletry kit, and a book.</p><p><strong>Large:</strong> approx. 20&quot; W &times; 15.5&quot; H &times; 8&quot; D — three to four days, or two people packing light; still overhead-bin friendly.</p><p><strong>What it fits:</strong> a wide-mouth opening and structured walls mean you pack it like a suitcase, not a duffel — folded knits, rolled shirts, shoes along the base, essentials in the interior pocket.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_ship": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping & Returns",
            "content": "<p>Free shipping on all orders over $75. Orders under $75 ship at a flat $4.99 (Standard Shipping), delivered within 7 to 10 business days.</p><p>Because each bag is made in limited production runs, sold-out sizes and colors may take 4 to 8 weeks to restock.</p><p>We accept returns within 30 days of delivery for items in original, unused condition with all tags attached. Exchanges are always free.</p>",
